            <td data-label="Polytechnic diploma">{item.poly}</td>
          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <p>
    Pick ITI to earn sooner and learn by doing with an employer near you. Pick the diploma for more theory and a clearer path to a degree. Our guide to the <a href="/blog/college-degrees/polytechnic-diploma-after-10th-which-trade-to-choose/">polytechnic diploma after 10th</a> covers state entry tests and trades in detail. For the wider comparison, see <a href="/blog/college-degrees/best-diploma-courses-after-12th/">best diploma courses after 12th</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 id="business">Four business layers on top of an ITI trade</h2>

  <p>
    You do not need to own a shop. But every ITI trade has a layer where the customer pays you directly, and learning it early is the difference between a fixed ladder and a growing income.
  </p>

  <div class="feature-cards">
    {businessLayers.map((item) => (
      <div class="layer-card">
        <div class="layer-card__label">{item.label}</div>
        <div class="layer-card__title">{item.title}</div>
