        <div class="path-card__row path-card__row--fit">{item.fit}</div>
        <div class="path-card__row path-card__row--watch">{item.watch}</div>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <p>
    The basic sales skills are the same for all four: say who you help and with what, quote a clear price, show photos of past work, follow up after the job and ask for one referral. One number worth watching is how many enquiries turn into paid jobs.
  </p>

  <h2 id="ai">Electric vehicles, solar, AI and automation</h2>

  <div class="work-style-grid">
    {aiRows.map((item) => (
      <div class="work-style-card">
        <div class="work-style-card__label">{item.label}</div>
        <div class="work-style-card__title">{item.title}</div>
        <p>{item.body}</p>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <p>
    A national scheme approved in 2025 plans to upgrade 1,000 government ITIs with industry-aligned trades. Whether your nearby ITI has been upgraded is a fact to check, not assume.
  </p>

  <div class="honest-take">
    <p class="honest-take__label">A better adjacent move</p>
    <p>
      If you like computers more than tools, COPA alone puts you against graduates for desk jobs. A skill-first route with visible projects, or a polytechnic diploma in computers with proof of work, usually beats a plain COPA certificate.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2 id="money">Fees, scholarships and the education-debt caution</h2>

  <p>
    A government ITI is the cheapest route in this whole topic. Private ITIs charge fees under state norms and have no single national ceiling, so ask for the full list in writing.
  </p>

  <div class="comparison-grid">
    <div class="compare-card compare-card--teal">
      <div class="compare-card__label">A planning heuristic</div>
      <ul>
        <li>As a strict heuristic, keep the course fee near 10% of the whole education budget. On Rs 10 lakh, that is about Rs 1 lakh, well above most government ITI costs.</li>
        <li>Spending above roughly 20% needs course-specific evidence: valid affiliation, working workshops and a verifiable placed list.</li>
        <li>Put the rest toward a toolkit, a phone, a safety kit and one added skill.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="compare-card compare-card--gold">
      <div class="compare-card__label">Debt and support</div>
      <ul>
        <li>Avoid an education loan for an ITI. The credential is not legally required for most trades, and trade pay starts low by our scalability rule.</li>
        <li>Some states reimburse fees in private ITIs for reserved categories, and post-matric scholarships exist through the National Scholarship Portal. Check eligibility there.</li>
        <li>Free videos and manuals cover much of the theory. Judge a paid course by its trainer, update date, practice work and refund terms.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="gates-block">
    <p class="gates-block__title">The 3 Gates: pass these before you pay for a seat.</p>
    <div class="gates-row">
      {gateItems.map((item) => (
