          <span class="gate__name">{item.title}</span>
          <p>{item.body}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="note-line">
    Pay figures here are indicative ranges and averages from public profiles, not exact or guaranteed amounts. Pay differs by city, employer, skill and year, and markets change. Check current job listings (for example on LinkedIn, Naukri or Indeed) and ask people working in the role before you decide. We found no reliable national pay survey for ITI trades, so we give none.
  </p>

